16	 *
17	 * <p>The canonical form is linefeed-delimited:
18	 * <pre>
19	 * {appKey}
20	 * {METHOD}
21	 * {rawPath}
22	 * {canonicalQuery}
23	 * {timestamp}
24	 * {nonce}
25	 * {bodyDigest}
