13	/**
14	 * Validates JWT request nonces using Redis SETNX with TTL to prevent
15	 * replay attacks on write operations.
16	 *
17	 * <p>The atomic {@code SET key value NX EX ttl} ensures that even under
18	 * concurrent requests, only the first write succeeds and subsequent
